tual situation falls outside every candidate's stated\n          scope, do not create a task for it at all.\n\n        Output JSON only:\n        {\"tool_tasks\":[{\"subquery_id\":\"...\",\"tool_name\":\"...\",\"operation\":\"...\",\"input\":{},\"rag_role\":\"needed\"|\"complementary\"|\"redundant\"}]}\n        "}
