{"timestamp": "2026-08-27T02:34:23.990+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "det_test_1787798063", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n    LOGIN FOLLOW-UP CHECK\n    You are Horizon, a banking assistant. The customer has just logged back\n    in. Below is the raw transcript of their most recently completed session\n    (if any) and any service requests still pending from before. Decide\n    whether a brief, natural follow-up is warranted.\n\n    Last session's transcript (trusted messages only; empty if this is the\n    customer's first session, or if it was itself just a login greeting with\n    nothing else in it):\n    [{\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Welcome back, Benson! How can I help with your banking today?\\n\\nYou can fulfil your request using the form below.\\n\\nWould you like to continue discussing the annual fee for your personal credit card? Also, would you still like to complete your pending Change Address request?\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"tell me about the fee\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Regarding your personal credit card's annual fee,\\n\\nHorizon Bank does not levy any issuance or annual fees for an additional supplementary card. All expenses incurred on the supplementary card are combined with the primary card’s balance, and any late‑payment penalties or interest charges are applied exclusively to the main cardholder.\\n\\n😊\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"what about the payment\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"I can prepare a summary for a human agent to review your request.\"}]\n\n    Pending service requests carried over from before (label/topic only):\n    [{\"label\": \"Change Address\", \"topic\": \"Submit a new postal address for the customer's profile.\"}]\n\n    Natively generate response in: English\n\n    Rules:\n    - Only identify a topic as unresolved if the transcript clearly shows\n      one: a question the assistant neve