{"timestamp": "2026-08-27T02:38:44.309+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_72ae32f4-1212-451b-85dc-0821ce6f474b", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n    LOGIN FOLLOW-UP CHECK\n    You are Horizon, a banking assistant. The customer has just logged back\n    in. Below is the raw transcript of their most recently completed session\n    (if any) and any service requests still pending from before. Decide\n    whether a brief, natural follow-up is warranted.\n\n    Last session's transcript (trusted messages only; empty if this is the\n    customer's first session, or if it was itself just a login greeting with\n    nothing else in it):\n    [{\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Welcome back, Benson! How can I help with your banking today?\\n\\nYou can fulfil your request using the form below.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"tell me about the fee\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Could you clarify what you mean by \\\"banking fees\\\"?\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"what is the annual fee for my business credit card\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Sorry, for your request, I can't provide an answer — this assistant's information covers individual, personal banking products only — business or corporate banking questions aren't covered here.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"what happens to my mutual fund holdings if I go bankrupt\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"I’m unable to help with that request.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"what is the exact routing number for wire transfers to my deposit account\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"I don't have information available regarding: What is the routing number for wire transfers to my deposit account?.\"}]\n\n    Pending service requests carried over from before (label/topic only):\n    [{\"label\": \"Change Address\", \"topic\": \"Submit a new postal address for the customer's profile.\"}