{"timestamp": "2026-08-27T02:41:24.828+00:00", "event": "llm.response", "session_id": "sess_72ae32f4-1212-451b-85dc-0821ce6f474b", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "raw_response": "{\n  \"elements\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"TEXT\",\n      \"source_task_ids\": [\n        \"task_1\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"Here is information on fees for your Horizon Bank credit card:\\n\\n• Late payment fees: To request a waiver of a late payment fee, you can send a message through the Horizon App's in-app chat service by specifying 'fee waiver' in your query. Our team will review your request and provide an update via push notification within {{faq_5e7c68_001}} working days.\\n\\n• Balance transfer fees: The monthly charge for balance transfers is calculated based on your outstanding balance. Prior to the final month of your tenure, a monthly fee of either {{faq_5f31fc26_001}} for transfers approved before August {{faq_5f31fc26_002}}, {{faq_5f31fc26_003}}, or {{faq_5f31fc26_004}} for transfers approved on or after August {{faq_5f31fc26_005}}, {{faq_5f31fc26_006}}, will apply and be included in your minimum payment due. In the last month, or if you repay early, a {{faq_5f31fc26_007}} fee on the remaining outstanding amount will apply. Please consult the Balance Transfer Product Terms and Key Facts document for detailed information.\\n\\n• Cash advance fees: Horizon Bank imposes a cash advance fee of {{faq_df0e6cbd_003}} on withdrawn amounts as of {{faq_df0e6cbd_001}} February {{faq_df0e6cbd_002}}, though transactions below {{faq_df0e6cbd_004}} are exempt. Additionally, a daily interest rate of {{faq_df0e6cbd_005}} (equivalent to {{faq_df0e6cbd_006}} per annum) applies from the transaction posting date until paid in full. From {{faq_df0e6cbd_007}} July {{faq_df0e6cbd_008}}, your Effective Interest Rate will be tailored to your individual credit profile, ranging from {{faq_df0e6cbd_009}} to {{faq_df0e6cbd_010}} per annum. (Effective Interest Rate is the annual cost of borrowing money, including interest and standard charges.)\\n\\n• Supplementary cards: Horizon Bank does not charge any issuance or annual fees for an additional card.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"clarification\": \"\"\n}", "elapsed_ms": 2325.63}
