{"timestamp": "2026-08-27T02:43:26.587+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_72ae32f4-1212-451b-85dc-0821ce6f474b", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently for whether its supplied\n        parents are response-ready: they must contain enough materially\n        relevant, grounded information for the assistant to give the customer\n        a useful FAQ response.\n\n        Original User Message (advisory context only; never use it as an\n        individual task's completeness target): tell me about the fee, and how to apply for a loan, and what is the exact routing number for wire transfers to my deposit account \n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nAI: Welcome back, Benson! How can I help with your banking today?\n\nYou can fulfil your request using the form below.\n\nWould you still like to complete your pending Change Address request?\nUser: tell me about the fee\nAI: Sorry, I couldn't find relevant FAQ details to answer that. Could you clarify what information you are looking for?\nUser: what is the exact routing number for wire transfers to my deposit account\nAI: I don't have information available regarding: Provide the routing number for wire transfers to my deposit account..\nUser: I am asking about fees for my credit card.\nAI: I can prepare a summary for a human agent to review your request.\nUser: tell me about the fee, and how to apply for a loan, and what is the exact routing number for wire transfers to my deposit account \n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"procedural\": \"Review the monthly statement to identify specific charges applied to your credit card account.\", \"policy\": \"Annual fees and transaction charges are determined by the specific credit card tier and usage.\", \"conceptual\": \"Credit card fees represent the costs associated with maintaining the account and processing various transactions.\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Credit_Card\", \"target_intent\": [\"Fees And Charges\"], \"customer_component\": \"Provide information regarding credit card fees.\", \"direct_query\": \"Provide information regarding credit card fees.\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_1\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Review the monthly statement to identify specific charges applied to your credit card account.\", \"policy\": \"Annual fees and transaction charges are determined by the specific credit card tier and usage.\", \"conceptual\": \"Credit card fees represent the costs associated with maintaining the account and processing various transactions.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_5f31fc26\", \"content\": \"Question: What factors determine the monthly fee for transferring my balance to a Horizon Bank credit card?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, the monthly charge for balance transfers is calculated based on the outstanding balance. Prior to the final month of your tenure, a monthly fee of either {{faq_5f31fc26_001}} for transfers approved before August {{faq_5f31fc26_002}}, {{faq_5f31fc26_003}}, or {{faq_5f31fc26_004}} for transfers approved on or after August {{faq_5f31fc26_005}}, {{faq_5f31fc26_006}}, will be applied to your Horizon Bank credit card statement. This fee will be included in the minimum payment due. In the last month of your tenure, or if you opt to repay your balance early, the remaining outstanding balance will be charged to your statement, along with a {{faq_5f31fc26_007}} fee on the outstanding amount, which will also be included in the minimum payment due. For detailed information, please consult the Balance Transfer Product Terms and Key Facts document provided by Horizon Bank.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_e5db6d91\", \"content\": \"Question: Are there any fees associated with obtaining a supplementary Horizon card?\\n\\nAnswer: - Horizon Bank does not levy any issuance or annual fees for an additional card. All expenses incurred on the supplementary card are combined with the primary card’s balance, and any late‑payment penalties or interest charges are applied exclusively to the main cardholder.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_25ce7c68\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the process for requesting a waiver of charges on my Horizon Bank credit card account?\\n\\nAnswer: To request a waiver of a late payment fee, simply send a message through the Horizon App's in-app chat service, specifying 'fee waiver' in your query. Our team will carefully review your request and provide an update via push notification within {{faq_25ce7c68_001}} working days.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_df0e6cbd\", \"content\": \"Question: What are the charges associated with withdrawing cash using my Horizon card?\\n\\nAnswer: As of {{faq_df0e6cbd_001}} February {{faq_df0e6cbd_002}}, Horizon Bank imposes a cash advance fee of {{faq_df0e6cbd_003}} on the withdrawn amount, although transactions below {{faq_df0e6cbd_004}} are exempt from this charge. Additionally, a daily interest rate of {{faq_df0e6cbd_005}} (equivalent to {{faq_df0e6cbd_006}} per annum) is applied to the withdrawn amount, starting from the transaction posting date until the payment is made in full. Please note that from {{faq_df0e6cbd_007}} July {{faq_df0e6cbd_008}}, your Effective Interest Rate will be tailored to your individual credit profile, ranging from {{faq_df0e6cbd_009}} to {{faq_df0e6cbd_010}} per annum.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"procedural\": \"Submit the online application form along with the required income and identification documents for review.\", \"policy\": \"Applicants must meet minimum age and income requirements to qualify for a personal loan product.\", \"conceptual\": \"A personal loan is a credit facility that provides a lump sum amount for various financial needs.\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Personal_Loan\", \"target_intent\": [\"Application\"], \"customer_component\": \"Provide information on how to apply for a loan.\", \"direct_query\": \"Provide information on how to apply for a loan.\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_2\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Submit the online application form along with the required income and identification documents for review.\", \"policy\": \"Applicants must meet minimum age and income requirements to qualify for a personal loan product.\", \"conceptual\": \"A personal loan is a credit facility that provides a lump sum amount for various financial needs.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_f9cce3c1\", \"content\": \"Question: If my Instant Loan request is declined, can I still submit applications for other Horizon Bank products such as a credit card or a savings account?\\n\\nAnswer: - Absolutely. A declined loan does not prevent you from applying for other Horizon Bank offerings. You simply need to start a new application tailored to the specific product you wish to obtain.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_75ed6e4d\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the typical timeframe for my loan to be approved?\\n\\nAnswer: - The vast majority of loans are approved and the amount is deposited into your Horizon savings account in about {{faq_75ed6e4d_001}} seconds.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_46c17d0e\", \"content\": \"Question: What steps do I need to take to initiate a balance transfer request with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To begin the balance transfer process, navigate to the Horizon App, select the 'More' option, and then proceed to the 'Loan' section, where you will find 'Other Flexible Loans' to commence your application.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"procedural\": \"Locate the bank routing number on your account statement or within the secure mobile banking portal.\", \"policy\": \"Wire transfers require the correct routing number and account details to ensure successful funds processing.\", \"conceptual\": \"The routing number is a unique identifier used to direct electronic funds transfers to your account.\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Deposit_Account\", \"target_intent\": [\"Payments And Transfers\"], \"customer_component\": \"Provide the routing number for wire transfers to my deposit account.\", \"direct_query\": \"Provide the routing number for wire transfers to my deposit account.\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_3\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Locate the bank routing number on your account statement or within the secure mobile banking portal.\", \"policy\": \"Wire transfers require the correct routing number and account details to ensure successful funds processing.\", \"conceptual\": \"The routing number is a unique identifier used to direct electronic funds transfers to your account.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_c0c586c8\", \"content\": \"Question: I’ve already linked my mobile number (or NRIC) to another bank for PayNow receipts. Can I also associate that same mobile number with my Horizon Bank account for PayNow?\\n\\nAnswer: - Yes, you may. However, you must first remove the existing association of your mobile number (or NRIC) with the other bank’s account before linking it to your Horizon Bank account.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_453239a8\", \"content\": \"Question: Is it possible to designate my Horizon Bank savings account as the recipient account for my payroll deposits?\\n\\nAnswer: Indeed, you can notify your employer to deposit your salary into your Horizon Bank savings account. Horizon Bank is now equipped to handle incoming salary payments, ensuring a seamless and efficient process.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_44bb339e\", \"content\": \"Question: How can I transfer funds from another bank to my Horizon Bank savings account if I don't want to use the FAST service?\\n\\nAnswer: You have the option to initiate a local funds transfer through the GIRO network from other banks to your specified Horizon Bank savings account. Please note that transfers using MEPS+ or RTGS are not available for this type of transaction.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_05669a00\", \"content\": \"Question: How can I arrange for recurring transfers to other bank accounts through Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, you can effortlessly set up recurring transfers to other bank accounts using our convenient AutoPay feature. To do so, follow these simple steps: \\n   - Access your Horizon App and navigate to the 'Payments' section, then choose either 'Bank Transfer' or 'Credit Card' to pay other banks' savings accounts or credit cards. \\n   - Add or select your payee, enter the transfer amount, and specify the desired schedule and frequency. \\n   - Confirm your details and complete the setup. \\n   Alternatively, you can also utilize the PayNow feature within the Horizon App by selecting 'PayNow' from the homepage, adding your payee, and configuring the transfer details. \\n   For a more streamlined experience, access the 'AutoPay' option under 'Payments', choose your saved payee, and input the necessary transfer information, including the amount, purpose, and transfer frequency.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contains `task.customer_component`: the intent\n          formulator's resolved sub-query for that task. Evaluate a task ONLY\n          against its own `customer_component` and that task's candidate\n          parents.\n        - Each Task Input may