ing number on your account statement or within the secure mobile banking portal.\", \"policy\": \"Wire transfers require the correct routing number and account details to ensure successful funds processing.\", \"conceptual\": \"The routing number is a unique identifier used to direct electronic funds transfers to your account.\", \"target_commercial_product\": [\"Deposit_Account\", \"Horizon_APP\"], \"target_intent\": [\"Account Management\", \"Application\", \"Authentication And Security\", \"Branch And ATM Locator\", \"Card Logistics\", \"Eligibility\", \"Features And Limits\", \"Fees And Charges\", \"General Inquiries\", \"Interest And Rates\", \"Payments And Transfers\", \"Profile Updates\", \"Rewards And Promotions\", \"Transaction Disputes\"], \"customer_component\": \"Provide the routing number for wire transfers to my deposit account.\", \"direct_query\": \"Provide the routing number for wire transfers to my deposit account.\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_3\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Locate the bank routing number on your account statement or within the secure mobile banking portal.\", \"policy\": \"Wire transfers require the correct routing number and account details to ensure successful funds processing.\", \"conceptual\": \"The routing number is a unique identifier used to direct electronic funds transfers to your account.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [{\"attempt\": 1, \"status\": \"INSUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [], \"reason\": \"The provided parents discuss PayNow, payroll deposits, and local funds transfers via GIRO, but none contain information regarding the routing number for wire transfers to a deposit account.\", \"evidence_delta\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_453239a8\", \"fact\": \"Horizon Bank savings accounts can receive payroll deposits.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_44bb339e\", \"fact\": \"Local funds transfers to Horizon Bank savings accounts can be initiated via the GIRO network.\"}]}, {\"attempt\": 2, \"status\": \"INSUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [], \"reason\": \"The provided parents explain how to locate an account number and how to add funds via FAST or PayNow, but they do not provide a routing number for wire transfers.\", \"evidence_delta\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_24638b08\", \"fact\": \"The Horizon Bank account number can be copied from the primary account card in the Savings section of the Horizon App.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_015d7e8a\", \"fact\": \"Funds can be added to a Horizon savings account via FAST transfer or PayNow.\"}]}], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_824abbaf\", \"content\": \"Question: What steps do I need to follow to change my mobile phone number after it has been linked to my Horizon Savings Account for PayNow?\\n\\nAnswer: - Updating your mobile number for PayNow can be done in three straightforward actions:\\n{{faq_824abbaf_001}}. Unlink the existing phone number from PayNow through the Horizon App.\\n{{faq_824abbaf_002}}. Enter and save your new mobile number in the app’s profile settings.\\n{{faq_824abbaf_003}}. Re‑enroll the new number for PayNow by associating it with your Horizon Savings Account.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_7d49c937\", \"content\": \"Question: What are the available ways to fund my Horizon Bank savings account?\\n\\nAnswer: - **Method {{faq_7d49c937_001}} – Bank transfer via FAST**\\n  {{faq_7d49c937_002}}. Log in to the online portal of your other bank.\\n  {{faq_7d49c937_003}}. Add your Horizon Bank savings account as a local beneficiary, providing the beneficiary name and your Horizon savings account number.\\n  {{faq_7d49c937_004}}. Initiate the FAST transfer; the money will be credited to your Horizon account shortly.\\n- **Method {{faq_7d49c937_005}} – PayNow**\\n  {{faq_7d49c937_006}}. If your mobile number or NRIC/FIN is already linked to PayNow with a different bank, first remove that linkage.\\n  {{faq_7d49c937_007}}. Open the Horizon App, tap the Payments tab, and select “Register for PayNow” if you haven’t done so already.\\n  {{faq_7d49c937_008}}. Complete the registration, then send a PayNow payment to the registered mobile number or NRIC/FIN; the funds will appear in your Horizon savings account.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_95665e33\", \"content\": \"Question: How do I locate my Horizon Bank account number within the app?\\n\\nAnswer: - Open the Horizon App and sign in.\\n- Navigate to the **Savings** tab.\\n- Your account number appears on the primary account card under the \\\"Main\\\" heading.\\n- To copy it, tap the card and select the copy icon shown in the \\\"Horizon savings account number\\\" panel.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_32c1662f\", \"content\": \"Question: Can I initiate a transfer in a currency other than Singapore dollars?\\n\\nAnswer: - Horizon Bank currently supports only domestic transfers denominated in SGD. We do not handle inbound or outbound foreign‑currency transfers, nor any cross‑border payments, whether they are in SGD or other currencies.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contains `task.customer_component`: the intent\n          formulator's resolved sub-query for that task. Evaluate a task ONLY\n          against its own `customer_component` and that task's candidate\n          parents.\n        - Each Task Input may include `prior_sufficiency_audit_history` from\n          earlier attempts for the same task in this turn. Read it before\n          judging the current candidates and remain consistent with its prior\n          sufficiency judgments. This history is internal audit context only;\n          it is not customer-facing evidence and does not authorize any new\n          factual claim.\n        - Classify each task as SUFFICIENT, PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT, or\n          INSUFFICIENT. Judge whether the supplied parents provide useful,\n          materially relevant information for the task—not whether they repeat\n          the customer's wording or expli