{"timestamp": "2026-08-27T03:31:16.833+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_c7cd92d8-44a1-4c8e-886f-57b36838bc16", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n    GROUNDEDNESS v2.0 — EVIDENCE AUDIT\n    You are an evidence-groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank assistant.\n\n    Permitted Evidence (Last Session Transcript and Pending Service Requests):\n    {\"last_session_transcript\": [{\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Welcome back, Benson! How can I help with your banking today?\\n\\nYou can fulfil your request using the form below.\\n\\nWould you still like to complete your pending Change Address request?\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"tell me about the fee\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Sorry, I couldn't find relevant FAQ details to answer that. Could you clarify what information you are looking for?\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"what is the exact routing number for wire transfers to my deposit account\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"I don't have information available regarding: Provide the routing number for wire transfers to my deposit account..\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"I am asking about fees for my credit card.\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"I can prepare a summary for a human agent to review your request.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"tell me about the fee, and how to apply for a loan, and what is the exact routing number for wire transfers to my deposit account \"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Regarding credit card fees, Horizon Bank imposes a cash advance fee of 8% on withdrawn amounts (transactions below S$5 are exempt), along with a daily interest rate of 0.077%. For balance transfers, monthly charges are calculated based on your outstanding balance, applying a fee of either 3% for transfers approved before August 13, 2026, or 1% for transfers approved on or after August 13, 2026. Additionally, you can request a waiver for a late payment fee by sending a message through the Horizon App's in-app chat service specifying 'fee waiver'. Supplementary cards do not carry any issuance or annual fees.\\n\\nOpen the Horizon App, go to the Money menu, and select Loan to initiate the process. You need to possess a Horizon credit card and have adequate unused credit limit.\\n\\nDownload the Horizon App, navigate to Product Selection, and choose Instant Loan to begin your application. Singapore citizens, permanent residents, and foreign nationals are permitted to apply, subject to credit-worthiness assessment and income criteria.\\n\\nRegarding your request for the exact routing number for wire transfers to your deposit account, Horizon Bank currently supports only domestic transfers denominated in Singapore dollars (SGD) and does not handle inbound or outbound foreign-currency transfers or cross-border payments.\"}], \"pending_service_requests\": [{\"label\": \"Change Address\", \"topic\": \"Submit a new postal address for the customer's profile.\"}]}\n\n    Customer-Facing Content:\n    Would you still like to complete your pending Change Address request?\n\n    \nPRECISION REFERENCE CONTRACT:\n- A token matching `{{faq_*}}` is a database-backed exact-value reference,\n  never missing, unknown, incomplete, or a customer-visible template.\n- It may represent an exact amount, rate, limit, date, threshold, or other\n  precise value. Treat it as the underlying approved fact for relevance,\n  sufficiency, generation, compliance, and groundedness.\n- Preserve the token exactly in any draft. The backend deterministically\n  substitutes its authoritative value only after outbound validation.\n- Never reject, weaken, or describe evidence as unavailable merely because the\n  exact value is represented by a `{{faq_*}}` token.\n- Within the stated scope, \"up to {{faq_*}}\" expresses an exact maximum. It\n  supports the bounded conclusion that the stated coverage or benefit does not\n  exceed that value. It does not, by itself, support claims about applications,\n  approvals, denials, exceptions, or who controls the limit.\n\n\n    TASK: Assess EVIDENCE GROUNDEDNESS ONLY. Do not assess conduct, tone,\n    regulatory compliance, or completeness — a separate auditor handles those.\n    Every factual claim, instruction, figure, or suggestion in the Customer-Facing\n    Content must be directly supported by the Permitted Evidence above; nothing\n    outside it may be used as a factual source.\n\n    \n    This is a login follow-up, not an answer to a customer question. It is\n    grounded only if every claim about \"what happened last time\" is directly\n    supported by \"last_session_transcript\", and every mention of a pending\n    request uses only the label/topic supplied in\n    \"pending_service_requests\". It must not state or imply that anything is\n    being executed, attached, or completed by this message itself -- it may\n    only ask whether the customer wants to continue. Reject it if it\n    describes an unresolved topic not actually visible in the transcript,\n    invents detail about a pending request beyond its label/topic, or claims\n    the last session concluded differently than the transcript shows.\n    \n\n    Output JSON only:\n    {\"evidence_grounded\": true/false, \"reason\": \"...\", \"evidence_violations\": [{\"scope\": \"...\", \"unsupported_content\": [\"verbatim phrase\"], \"evidence_gap\": \"...\"}]}\n    "}
