{"timestamp": "2026-08-27T03:32:27.421+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_c7cd92d8-44a1-4c8e-886f-57b36838bc16", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently for whether its supplied\n        parents are response-ready: they must contain enough materially\n        relevant, grounded information for the assistant to give the customer\n        a useful FAQ response.\n\n        Original User Message (advisory context only; never use it as an\n        individual task's completeness target): tell me about the fee, and how to apply for a loan, and what is the exact routing number for wire transfers to my deposit account \n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nAI: Welcome back, Benson! How can I help with your banking today?\n\nYou can fulfil your request using the form below.\n\nWould you still like to complete your pending Change Address request?\nUser: I am asking about fees for my credit card.\nAI: Hello! 💳 Here is some helpful information regarding Horizon Bank credit card fees:\n\n• **Late Payment Fee Waivers:** To request a waiver for a late payment fee, you can send a message through the Horizon App's in-app chat service by specifying 'fee waiver' in your query. Our team will review your request and provide an update via push notification within 3 working days.\n\n• **Balance Transfers:** The monthly charge for balance transfers is calculated based on your outstanding balance. For transfers approved before August 13, 2026, the monthly fee is 3%. For transfers approved on or after August 13, 2026, the monthly fee is 1%. In the last month of your tenure, or if you repay early, a 1% fee on the remaining outstanding amount applies.\n\n• **Cash Advances:** Withdrawing cash using your Horizon card incurs a cash advance fee of 8% on the withdrawn amount (transactions below S$5 are exempt). A daily interest rate of 0.077% (equivalent to 27.9% per annum) also applies from the posting date until full payment. From 1 July 2026, Effective Interest Rates will be tailored to individual credit profiles, ranging from 18.9% to 29.9% per annum.\n\n• **Supplementary Cards:** Horizon Bank does not levy any issuance or annual fees for an additional supplementary card.\nUser: tell me about the fee, and how to apply for a loan, and what is the exact routing number for wire transfers to my deposit account \n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"procedural\": \"Submit the required identification and income documents through the online portal to begin the review.\", \"policy\": \"Applicants must meet the minimum age and income requirements to qualify for a personal loan.\", \"conceptual\": \"A personal loan is a credit facility that provides a lump sum of cash for various needs.\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Personal_Loan\", \"target_intent\": [\"Account Management\", \"Application\", \"Authentication And Security\", \"Eligibility\", \"Features And Limits\", \"Fees And Charges\", \"General Inquiries\", \"Interest And Rates\", \"Loan And Credit Management\", \"Rewards And Promotions\"], \"customer_component\": \"Explain the application process for a loan.\", \"direct_query\": \"Explain the application process for a loan.\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_2\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Submit the required identification and income documents through the online portal to begin the review.\", \"policy\": \"Applicants must meet the minimum age and income requirements to qualify for a personal loan.\", \"conceptual\": \"A personal loan is a credit facility that provides a lump sum of cash for various needs.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [{\"attempt\": 1, \"status\": \"INSUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [], \"reason\": \"The provided parents discuss loan approval timeframes, declined loan procedures, and balance transfer initiation, but do not provide information on the application process for a personal loan as requested.\", \"evidence_delta\": []}], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_5deed8da\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the process for repaying my Horizon Bank loan?\\n\\nAnswer: - The loan installment is automatically posted to your Horizon credit card statement each month, and you can clear it via that statement.\\n- Open the Horizon App, navigate to Money → Credit Card, and select Pay Credit Card.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_1946c44f\", \"content\": \"Question: What steps should I follow to request an Instant Loan from Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: - Open the Horizon App, go to the **Money** menu, and select **Loan** to initiate the process.\\n- If you are not yet a Horizon customer, first download the Horizon App, then navigate to **Product Selection** and choose **Instant Loan** to begin your application.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_952e4559\", \"content\": \"Question: What does Horizon Bank’s Instant Loan product involve?\\n\\nAnswer: Instant Loan is a Horizon Bank offering in Singapore that enables you to convert a portion of the available credit on your Horizon credit card into cash.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_2109a75e\", \"content\": \"Question: How does Horizon Bank calculate the monthly payment for my loan?\\n\\nAnswer: - The monthly payment is computed by summing the approved principal amount with the total interest that will accrue over the loan term, and then dividing that combined figure by the total number of months in the loan period. For additional details, please consult the Horizon Instant Loan Terms & Conditions.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"task\"