u repay early, a 1% fee on the remaining outstanding amount applies.\n\n• **Cash Advances:** Withdrawing cash using your Horizon card incurs a cash advance fee of 8% on the withdrawn amount (transactions below S$5 are exempt). A daily interest rate of 0.077% (equivalent to 27.9% per annum) also applies from the posting date until full payment. From 1 July 2026, Effective Interest Rates will be tailored to individual credit profiles, ranging from 18.9% to 29.9% per annum.\n\n• **Supplementary Cards:** Horizon Bank does not levy any issuance or annual fees for an additional supplementary card.\nUser: tell me about the fee, and how to apply for a loan, and what is the exact routing number for wire transfers to my deposit account \n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"procedural\": \"Locate the bank identification code and account number within your digital banking dashboard for incoming transfers.\", \"policy\": \"Wire transfers require the correct bank routing number to ensure funds are credited to the account.\", \"conceptual\": \"A routing number is a unique identifier used to direct electronic funds to the correct financial institution.\", \"target_commercial_product\": [\"Deposit_Account\", \"Horizon_APP\"], \"target_intent\": [\"Account Management\", \"Application\", \"Authentication And Security\", \"Branch And ATM Locator\", \"Card Logistics\", \"Eligibility\", \"Features And Limits\", \"Fees And Charges\", \"General Inquiries\", \"Interest And Rates\", \"Payments And Transfers\", \"Profile Updates\", \"Rewards And Promotions\", \"Transaction Disputes\"], \"customer_component\": \"Provide the routing number for wire transfers to my deposit account.\", \"direct_query\": \"Provide the routing number for wire transfers to my deposit account.\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_3\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Locate the bank identification code and account number within your digital banking dashboard for incoming transfers.\", \"policy\": \"Wire transfers require the correct bank routing number to ensure funds are credited to the account.\", \"conceptual\": \"A routing number is a unique identifier used to direct electronic funds to the correct financial institution.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [{\"attempt\": 1, \"status\": \"INSUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [], \"reason\": \"The provided parents discuss PayNow, payroll deposits, and funds transfers via GIRO or AutoPay, but do not provide the routing number for wire transfers to a deposit account.\", \"evidence_delta\": []}, {\"attempt\": 2, \"status\": \"INSUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [], \"reason\": \"The provided parents discuss how to locate an account number and how to add funds via FAST or PayNow, but none of the parents provide a routing number for wire transfers, which is the specific information requested.\", \"evidence_delta\": []}], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_824abbaf\", \"content\": \"Question: What steps do I need to follow to change my mobile phone number after it has been linked to my Horizon Savings Account for PayNow?\\n\\nAnswer: - Updating your mobile number for PayNow can be done in three straightforward actions:\\n{{faq_824abbaf_001}}. Unlink the existing phone number from PayNow through the Horizon App.\\n{{faq_824abbaf_002}}. Enter and save your new mobile number in the app’s profile settings.\\n{{faq_824abbaf_003}}. Re‑enroll the new number for PayNow by associating it with your Horizon Savings Account.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_7d49c937\", \"content\": \"Question: What are the available ways to fund my Horizon Bank savings account?\\n\\nAnswer: - **Method {{faq_7d49c937_001}} – Bank transfer via FAST**\\n  {{faq_7d49c937_002}}. Log in to the online portal of your other bank.\\n  {{faq_7d49c937_003}}. Add your Horizon Bank savings account as a local beneficiary, providing the beneficiary name and your Horizon savings account number.\\n  {{faq_7d49c937_004}}. Initiate the FAST transfer; the money will be credited to your Horizon account shortly.\\n- **Method {{faq_7d49c937_005}} – PayNow**\\n  {{faq_7d49c937_006}}. If your mobile number or NRIC/FIN is already linked to PayNow with a different bank, first remove that linkage.\\n  {{faq_7d49c937_007}}. Open the Horizon App, tap the Payments tab, and select “Register for PayNow” if you haven’t done so already.\\n  {{faq_7d49c937_008}}. Complete the registration, then send a PayNow payment to the registered mobile number or NRIC/FIN; the funds will appear in your Horizon savings account.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_95665e33\", \"content\": \"Question: How do I locate my Horizon Bank account number within the app?\\n\\nAnswer: - Open the Horizon App and sign in.\\n- Navigate to the **Savings** tab.\\n- Your account number appears on the primary account card under the \\\"Main\\\" heading.\\n- To copy it, tap the card and select the copy icon shown in the \\\"Horizon savings account number\\\" panel.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_32c1662f\", \"content\": \"Question: Can I initiate a transfer in a currency other than Singapore dollars?\\n\\nAnswer: - Horizon Bank currently supports only domestic transfers denominated in SGD. We do not handle inbound or outbound foreign‑currency transfers, nor any cross‑border payments, whether they are in SGD or other currencies.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contains `task.customer_component`: the intent\n          formulator's resolved sub-query for that task. Evaluate a task ONLY\n          against its own `customer_component` and that task's candidate\n          parents.\n        - Each Task Input may include `prior_sufficiency_audit_history` from\n          earlier attempts for the same task in this turn. Read it before\n          judging the current candidates and remain consistent with its prior\n          sufficiency judgments. This history is internal audit c