{"timestamp": "2026-08-27T04:22:52.196+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_a003c00f-8518-4501-80b3-d7d918feb1c4", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently for whether its supplied\n        parents are response-ready: they must contain enough materially\n        relevant, grounded information for the assistant to give the customer\n        a useful FAQ response.\n\n        Original User Message (advisory context only; never use it as an\n        individual task's completeness target): tell me about the fee, and how to apply for a loan, and what is the exact routing number for wire transfers to my deposit account \n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nAI: Welcome back, Benson! How can I help with your banking today?\n\nYou can fulfil your request using the form below.\nUser: tell me about the fee, and how to apply for a loan, and what is the exact routing number for wire transfers to my deposit account \n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"procedural\": \"Submit the online application form with your identification documents and proof of income for review.\", \"policy\": \"Applicants must meet minimum age requirements and provide valid proof of income to qualify for approval.\", \"conceptual\": \"A personal loan provides a lump sum of cash repaid in fixed monthly installments over a term.\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Personal_Loan\", \"target_intent\": [\"Application\"], \"customer_component\": \"Explain the application process for a loan.\", \"direct_query\": \"Explain the application process for a loan.\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_2\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Submit the online application form with your identification documents and proof of income for review.\", \"policy\": \"Applicants must meet minimum age requirements and provide valid proof of income to qualify for approval.\", \"conceptual\": \"A personal loan provides a lump sum of cash repaid in fixed monthly installments over a term.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_75ed6e4d\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the typical timeframe for my loan to be approved?\\n\\nAnswer: - The vast majority of loans are approved and the amount is deposited into your Horizon savings account in about {{faq_75ed6e4d_001}} seconds.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_f9cce3c1\", \"content\": \"Question: If my Instant Loan request is declined, can I still submit applications for other Horizon Bank products such as a credit card or a savings account?\\n\\nAnswer: - Absolutely. A declined loan does not prevent you from applying for other Horizon Bank offerings. You simply need to start a new application tailored to the specific product you wish to obtain.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_46c17d0e\", \"content\": \"Question: What steps do I need to take to initiate a balance transfer request with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To begin the balance transfer process, navigate to the Horizon App, select the 'More' option, and then proceed to the 'Loan' section, where you will find 'Other Flexible Loans' to commence your application.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"procedural\": \"Locate your routing number on your monthly account statement or within the account details section online.\", \"policy\": \"Routing numbers are specific to the bank and are required for all incoming and outgoing wire transfers.\", \"conceptual\": \"A routing number is a unique nine-digit code used to identify a financial institution during electronic transactions.\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Deposit_Account\", \"target_intent\": [\"General Inquiries\"], \"customer_component\": \"Provide the routing number for wire transfers to my deposit account.\", \"direct_query\": \"Provide the routing number for wire transfers to my deposit account.\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_3\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Locate your routing number on your monthly account statement or within the account details section online.\", \"policy\": \"Routing numbers are specific to the bank and are required for all incoming and outgoing wire transfers.\", \"conceptual\": \"A routing number is a unique nine-digit code used to identify a financial institution during electronic transactions.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_7672e1dd\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the procedure for paying my Horizon credit card bill?\\n\\nAnswer: - **Using a Horizon savings account**\\n  - Sign in to the Horizon App.\\n  - Navigate to **Money** → **Credit Card** → **Pay credit card**.\\n  - Your Horizon Savings account will appear; pick it from the list.\\n  - Verify the payment details and swipe up to authorise.\\n  - For guidance on funding your Horizon Savings account, visit: https://horizonbank.sg/faqs/savings-account/#how-do-i-deposit-money-into-my-savings-account\\n\\n- **Using accounts at other banks**\\n  You may settle your Horizon credit card bill from another bank either by adding the card number as a FAST local transfer or as a credit‑card recipient. Below are the typical flows for major Singapore banks.\\n\\n  **DBS/POSB**\\n  *Option {{faq_7672e1dd_001}} – Local recipient (instant)*\\n  - Open **Pay & Transfer** > **Local** > **Add Local Recipient** > **Bank Account**.\\n  - Input the recipient name, select **Horizon Bank Singapore Limited**, and type your {{faq_7672e1dd_002}}‑digit Horizon card number as the account number.\\n  - Confirm the details and add the recipient (additional verification may be required).\\n  - Return to **Pay & Transfer** > **Local**, choose your Horizon card, enter the amount, ensure **FAST** is enabled, and proceed.\\n\\n  *Option {{faq_7672e1dd_003}} – Credit‑card recipient (up to {{faq_7672e1dd_004}} working days)*\\n  - Go to **Pay & Transfer** > **Cards** > **Add Credit Card Recipient**.\\n  - Provide your {{faq_7672e1dd_005}}‑digit Horizon card number, select card type **Singapore – VISA/MasterCard**, and fill in your name.\\n  - After adding, select the card under **Cards**, input the payment amount, and confirm.\\n\\n  **UOB**\\n  - Choose **Pay & Transfer** > **Other Accounts / Cards** > **New Transfer**.\\n  - Under **Bank Account / Other Institutions**, pick “Horizon Bank Singapore Limited” and enter your {{faq_7672e1dd_006}}‑digit Horizon card number.\\n  - Specify the amount and swipe to submit.\\n\\n  **OCBC**\\n  - Tap **Local Transfers** > **Account Number** > **Add payee**.\\n  - Enter the payee name, select **Horizon Bank Singapore Limited**, and type your Horizon card number (use your initials for the reference).\\n  - After adding, wait roughly {{faq_7672e1dd_007}} hours for the payee to become active, then initiate a local transfer to the card and confirm.\\n\\n  **Standard Chartered Bank Singapore**\\n  *Option {{faq_7672e1dd_008}} – Local recipient (instant)*\\n  - Open the menu > **Transfer & Payments** > **Local Transfer**.\\n  - Add a new payee, choose **Local**, enter “Horizon Bank Singapore Limited” and your {{faq_7672e1dd_009}}‑digit Horizon card number.\\n  - Authenticate with your {{faq_7672e1dd_010}}‑digit PIN and confirm.\\n  - Select the newly added Horizon card as the destination, enter the amount, and swipe to complete.\\n\\n  *Option {{faq_7672e1dd_011}} – Credit‑card recipient (up to {{faq_7672e1dd_012}} working days)*\\n  - Menu > **Transfers & Payments** > **Add & Manage Biller** > **Other Bank’s Credit Card Payee**.\\n  - Provide the cardholder name and your Horizon card number, then continue.\\n  - After confirming the payee, enter your PIN, choose **Move My Money**, pick **Pay Other Bank Credit Cards**, select the Horizon card as the payee, specify the source account and amount, and finalize.\\n\\n  For any bank not listed, you can still add your Horizon card number either as a FAST local transfer or as a credit‑card recipient; processing typically takes about {{faq_7672e1dd_013}} working days.\\n\\n  **Important note**: If you hold both a Horizon savings account and a Horizon credit card, ensure the card is paired with the savings account before using the paired‑payment method. Details on pairing are available at https://horizonbank.sg/faqs/credit-card/#how-does-the-card-pairing-work.\\n\\n  Failure to pay by the due date may result in a late‑payment fee and interest on the outstanding balance. Making only the minimum payment also incurs interest on the remaining amount. For full terms, consult the Horizon FAQs or the customer T&Cs on the website or app.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_f87ebecc\", \"content\": \"Question: Could you provide the necessary codes for identifying Horizon Bank, including the bank code and BIC code?\\n\\nAnswer: For your reference, Horizon Bank Singapore Limited can be identified by the following codes: \\n      * Bank Name: Horizon Bank Singapore Limited\\n      * Bank Code: {{faq_f87ebecc_001}}\\n      * BIC Code: HRZNSGSG\\n      * Branch Code: {{faq_f87ebecc_002}}\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_13757d59\", \"content\": \"Question: Is it possible to arrange for periodic deposits into my Horizon Bank savings account?\\n\\nAnswer: Indeed, you can establish a recurring local funds transfer, such as a Standing Instruction or Scheduled Transfer, from other banks to your specified Horizon Bank savings account. To do so, simply utilize the banking channels provided by other banks to specify the desired payment frequency, amount, and the Horizon Bank account number where you wish to receive the funds.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_ce650cb6\", \"content\": \"Question: If I change my mobile number, will the previous number linked to PayNow be removed automatically?\\n\\nAnswer: - No, the old mobile number stays active in PayNow until you manually remove it. You can deregister it from the Horizon App using either of the following methods:\\n\\na) Via the Payments area:\\n   • Open the app and go to Money → Payments → Settings (tap the three‑dot icon).\\n   • Select PayNow Registration → Your registered mobile number → Deregister mobile number.\\n\\nb) While updating your contact information:\\n   • Go to Profile → Settings → Personal Details.\\n   • Edit the phone number, submit the change, then choose to deregister the previous number from PayNow.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contains `task.customer_component`: the intent\n          formulator's resolved sub-query for that task. Evaluate a task ONLY\n          against its own `customer_component` and that task's candidate\n          parents.\n        - Each Task Input may include `prior_sufficiency_audit_history` from\n          earlier attempts for the same task in this turn. Read it before\n          judging the current candidates and remain consistent with its prior\n          sufficiency judgments. This history is internal audit context only;\n          it is not customer-facing evidence and does not authorize any new\n          factual claim.\n        - Classify each task as SUFFICIENT, PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT, or\n          INSUFFICIENT. Judge whether the supplied parents provide useful,\n          materially relevant information for the task—not whether they repeat\n          the customer's wording or explicitly resolve every possible\n          interpretation of the customer's question.\n        - PARTIAL-EVIDENCE DECISION ORDER: First identify whether any supplied\n          parent contains a factual propositi