igit code used to identify a financial institution during electronic transactions.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [{\"attempt\": 1, \"status\": \"INSUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [], \"reason\": \"The provided parents discuss credit card payment procedures, bank identification codes (BIC/Bank Code), and recurring deposits, but none provide the routing number for wire transfers to a deposit account.\", \"evidence_delta\": []}], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_c0c586c8\", \"content\": \"Question: I’ve already linked my mobile number (or NRIC) to another bank for PayNow receipts. Can I also associate that same mobile number with my Horizon Bank account for PayNow?\\n\\nAnswer: - Yes, you may. However, you must first remove the existing association of your mobile number (or NRIC) with the other bank’s account before linking it to your Horizon Bank account.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_d8a16071\", \"content\": \"Question: Am I allowed to send or receive payments to third parties directly from my Horizon Bank Savings Pots?\\n\\nAnswer: - All external transfers—whether sending or receiving funds—must be performed using your primary Horizon Bank account. Savings Pots are not designed for direct transactions with other individuals or financial institutions.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_453239a8\", \"content\": \"Question: Is it possible to designate my Horizon Bank savings account as the recipient account for my payroll deposits?\\n\\nAnswer: Indeed, you can notify your employer to deposit your salary into your Horizon Bank savings account. Horizon Bank is now equipped to handle incoming salary payments, ensuring a seamless and efficient process.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_24638b08\", \"content\": \"Question: How can I locate my Horizon Bank account number?\\n\\nAnswer: - Open the Horizon App and sign in.\\n- Choose the “Savings” section.\\n- Your account number is displayed on the primary account card, following the labe