{"timestamp": "2026-08-27T04:47:11.313+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_a650460c-4278-49b4-8f5e-819a1668a1ab", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently for whether its supplied\n        parents are response-ready: they must contain enough materially\n        relevant, grounded information for the assistant to give the customer\n        a useful FAQ response.\n\n        Original User Message (advisory context only; never use it as an\n        individual task's completeness target): tell me about the fee, and how to apply for a loan, and what is the exact routing number for wire transfers to my deposit account \n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nAI: Welcome back, Benson! How can I help with your banking today?\n\nYou can fulfil your request using the form below.\n\nWould you like to clarify your question about banking fees from our last session? Additionally, do you still want to complete your request to change your address?\nUser: tell me about the fee, and how to apply for a loan, and what is the exact routing number for wire transfers to my deposit account \n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"procedural\": \"Review the fee schedule document to identify applicable charges for your specific account type.\", \"policy\": \"Account fees are applied based on the terms and conditions agreed upon at account opening.\", \"conceptual\": \"Banking fees are standard charges for maintaining an account or performing specific financial transactions.\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Deposit_Account\", \"target_intent\": [\"Fees And Charges\"], \"customer_component\": \"Explain the banking fees associated with my account.\", \"direct_query\": \"Explain the banking fees associated with my account.\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_1\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Review the fee schedule document to identify applicable charges for your specific account type.\", \"policy\": \"Account fees are applied based on the terms and conditions agreed upon at account opening.\", \"conceptual\": \"Banking fees are standard charges for maintaining an account or performing specific financial transactions.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_a1fd1b2a\", \"content\": \"Question: Does Horizon Bank charge any fee for closing an account?\\n\\nAnswer: - No fee is applied when you close your Horizon Bank account. Interest earned during the month of closure will not be credited.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_98273851\", \"content\": \"Question: Will I be charged any fees for using Horizon Bank or SCB ATMs?\\n\\nAnswer: No, you will not incur any fees for ATM transactions with Horizon Bank or SCB.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_33f7a546\", \"content\": \"Question: Are there any fees for using Horizon Bank or SCB ATMs?\\n\\nAnswer: - No, there are absolutely no charges for using these ATMs.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_df2c5fa7\", \"content\": \"Question: Does Horizon Bank apply any fees when I transfer money to or from my Horizon Savings Account?\\n\\nAnswer: - No, Horizon Bank does not charge any fee for sending or receiving Singapore‑dollar transfers into a Horizon Savings Account.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"procedural\": \"Submit your application through the online portal by providing your personal identification and income documentation.\", \"policy\": \"Applicants must meet minimum age and income requirements to qualify for a personal loan product.\", \"conceptual\": \"A personal loan is a credit facility that provides a lump sum of money for personal use.\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Personal_Loan\", \"target_intent\": [\"Application\"], \"customer_component\": \"Provide information on how to apply for a loan.\", \"direct_query\": \"Provide information on how to apply for a loan.\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_2\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Submit your application through the online portal by providing your personal identification and income documentation.\", \"policy\": \"Applicants must meet minimum age and income requirements to qualify for a personal loan product.\", \"conceptual\": \"A personal loan is a credit facility that provides a lump sum of money for personal use.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_f9cce3c1\", \"content\": \"Question: If my Instant Loan request is declined, can I still submit applications for other Horizon Bank products such as a credit card or a savings account?\\n\\nAnswer: - Absolutely. A declined loan does not prevent you from applying for other Horizon Bank offerings. You simply need to start a new application tailored to the specific product you wish to obtain.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_75ed6e4d\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the typical timeframe for my loan to be approved?\\n\\nAnswer: - The vast majority of loans are approved and the amount is deposited into your Horizon savings account in about {{faq_75ed6e4d_001}} seconds.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_46c17d0e\", \"content\": \"Question: What steps do I need to take to initiate a balance transfer request with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To begin the balance transfer process, navigate to the Horizon App, select the 'More' option, and then proceed to the 'Loan' section, where you will find 'Other Flexible Loans' to commence your application.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"procedural\": \"Locate your unique routing number on your monthly account statement or within the mobile banking app.\", \"policy\": \"Routing numbers are specific to the bank and are required for all incoming wire transfer transactions.\", \"conceptual\": \"A routing number is a unique identifier used to direct funds to the correct financial institution.\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Deposit_Account\", \"target_intent\": [\"Payments And Transfers\"], \"customer_component\": \"Provide the routing number for wire transfers to my deposit account.\", \"direct_query\": \"Provide the routing number for wire transfers to my deposit account.\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_3\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Locate your unique routing number on your monthly account statement or within the mobile banking app.\", \"policy\": \"Routing numbers are specific to the bank and are required for all incoming wire transfer transactions.\", \"conceptual\": \"A routing number is a unique identifier used to direct funds to the correct financial institution.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_c0c586c8\", \"content\": \"Question: I’ve already linked my mobile number (or NRIC) to another bank for PayNow receipts. Can I also associate that same mobile number with my Horizon Bank account for PayNow?\\n\\nAnswer: - Yes, you may. However, you must first remove the existing association of your mobile number (or NRIC) with the other bank’s account before linking it to your Horizon Bank account.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_453239a8\", \"content\": \"Question: Is it possible to designate my Horizon Bank savings account as the recipient account for my payroll deposits?\\n\\nAnswer: Indeed, you can notify your employer to deposit your salary into your Horizon Bank savings account. Horizon Bank is now equipped to handle incoming salary payments, ensuring a seamless and efficient process.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_44bb339e\", \"content\": \"Question: How can I transfer funds from another bank to my Horizon Bank savings account if I don't want to use the FAST service?\\n\\nAnswer: You have the option to initiate a local funds transfer through the GIRO network from other banks to your specified Horizon Bank savings account. Please note that transfers using MEPS+ or RTGS are not available for this type of transaction.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_05669a00\", \"content\": \"Question: How can I arrange for recurring transfers to other bank accounts through Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, you can effortlessly set up recurring transfers to other bank accounts using our convenient AutoPay feature. To do so, follow these simple steps: \\n   - Access your Horizon App and navigate to the 'Payments' section, then choose either 'Bank Transfer' or 'Credit Card' to pay other banks' savings accounts or credit cards. \\n   - Add or select your payee, enter the transfer amount, and specify the desired schedule and frequency. \\n   - Confirm your details and complete the setup. \\n   Alternatively, you can also utilize the PayNow feature within the Horizon App by selecting 'PayNow' from the homepage, adding your payee, and configuring the transfer details. \\n   For a more streamlined experience, access the 'AutoPay' option under 'Payments', choose your saved payee, and input the necessary transfer information, including the amount, purpose, and transfer frequency.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contains `task.customer_component`: the intent\n          formulator's resolved sub-query for that task. Evaluate a task ONLY\n          against its own `customer_component` and that task's candidate\n          parents.\n        - Each Task Input may include `prior_sufficiency_audit_history` from\n          earlier attempts for the same task in this turn. Read it before\n          judging the current candidates and remain consistent