{"timestamp": "2026-08-27T05:44:56.549+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_a650460c-4278-49b4-8f5e-819a1668a1ab", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently for whether its supplied\n        parents are response-ready: they must contain enough materially\n        relevant, grounded information for the assistant to give the customer\n        a useful FAQ response.\n\n        Original User Message (advisory context only; never use it as an\n        individual task's completeness target): tell me about the fee, and how to apply for a loan, and what is the exact routing number for wire transfers to my deposit account\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nUser: tell me about the fee, and how to apply for a loan, and what is the exact routing number for wire transfers to my deposit account\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"procedural\": \"Submit the online application form with required identification documents and proof of income for review.\", \"policy\": \"Applicants must meet minimum age requirements and maintain a stable income to qualify for approval.\", \"conceptual\": \"A personal loan provides a lump sum of cash repaid in fixed monthly installments over time.\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Personal_Loan\", \"target_intent\": [\"Account Management\", \"Application\", \"Authentication And Security\", \"Eligibility\", \"Features And Limits\", \"Fees And Charges\", \"General Inquiries\", \"Interest And Rates\", \"Loan And Credit Management\", \"Rewards And Promotions\"], \"customer_component\": \"Explain the procedure for applying for a loan.\", \"direct_query\": \"Explain the procedure for applying for a loan.\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_2\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Submit the online application form with required identification documents and proof of income for review.\", \"policy\": \"Applicants must meet minimum age requirements and maintain a stable income to qualify for approval.\", \"conceptual\": \"A personal loan provides a lump sum of cash repaid in fixed monthly installments over time.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [{\"attempt\": 1, \"status\": \"INSUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [], \"reason\": \"The provided parents discuss loan approval timeframes, the ability to apply for other products after a decline, and the process for balance transfers. None of these provide the procedure for applying for a personal loan.\", \"evidence_delta\": []}], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_5deed8da\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the process for repaying my Horizon Bank loan?\\n\\nAnswer: - The loan installment is automatically posted to your Horizon credit card statement each month, and you can clear it via that statement.\\n- Open the Horizon App, navigate to Money → Credit Card, and select Pay Credit Card.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_1946c44f\", \"content\": \"Question: What steps should I follow to request an Instant Loan from Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: - Open the Horizon App, go to the **Money** menu, and select **Loan** to initiate the process.\\n- If you are not yet a Horizon customer, first download the Horizon App, then navigate to **Product Selection** and choose **Instant Loan** to begin your application.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_2109a75e\", \"content\": \"Question: How does Horizon Bank calculate the monthly payment for my loan?\\n\\nAnswer: - The monthly payment is computed by summing the approved principal amount with the total interest that will accrue over the loan term, and then dividing that combined figure by the total number of months in the loan period. For additional details, please consult the Horizon Instant Loan Terms & Conditions.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_0ae0bb51\", \"content\": \"Question: Do I qualify for Horizon Bank’s Instant Loan offering?\\n\\nAnswer: - **For current Horizon Bank clients:**\\n  * You need to possess a Horizon credit card and have adequate unused credit limit.\\n- **For new applicants:**\\n  * Singapore citizens, permanent residents, and foreign nationals are all permitted to apply for the Instant Loan.\\n  * Every submission will be subject to Horizon Bank’s credit‑worthiness assessment.\\n\\nYou may request a credit facility provided you satisfy the following criteria:\\n- You are aged between {{faq_0ae0bb51_001}} and {{faq_0ae0bb51_002}} years.\\n- Your annual income is at least {{faq_0ae0bb51_003}} if you are a Singapore citizen or permanent resident.\\n- Your annual income is at least {{faq_0ae0bb51_004}} if you are a foreigner holding a valid work pass.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"procedural\": \"Locate the nine-digit routing number on your monthly statement or within the secure mobile banking app.\", \"policy\": \"Routing numbers are specific to the financial institution and are required for all incoming wire transfers.\", \"conceptual\": \"A routing number is a unique identifier used to direct funds to the correct bank during transfers.\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Deposit_Account\", \"target_intent\": [\"Account Management\", \"Application\", \"Authentication And Security\", \"Branch And ATM Locator\", \"Card Logistics\", \"Eligibility\", \"Features And Limits\", \"Fees And Charges\", \"General Inquiries\", \"Interest And Rates\", \"Payments And Transfers\", \"Profile Updates\", \"Rewards And Promotions\", \"Transaction Disputes\"], \"customer_component\": \"Provide the routing number for wire transfers to my deposit account.\", \"direct_query\": \"Provide the routing number for wire transfers to my deposit account.\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_3\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Locate the nine-digit routing number on your monthly statement or within the secure mobile banking app.\", \"policy\": \"Routing numbers are specific to the financial institution and are required for all incoming wire transfers.\", \"conceptual\": \"A routing number is a unique identifier used to direct funds to the correct bank during transfers.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [{\"attempt\": 1, \"status\": \"INSUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [], \"reason\": \"The provided parents discuss PayNow, payroll deposits, GIRO transfers, and recurring transfers. None of these provide the routing number for wire transfers to a deposit account.\", \"evidence_delta\": []}], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_d8a16071\", \"content\": \"Question: Am I allowed to send or receive payments to third parties directly from my Horizon Bank Savings Pots?\\n\\nAnswer: - All external transfers—whether sending or receiving funds—must be performed using your primary Horizon Bank account. Savings Pots are not designed for direct transactions with other individuals or financial institutions.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_24638b08\", \"content\": \"Question: How can I locate my Horizon Bank account number?\\n\\nAnswer: - Open the Horizon App and sign in.\\n- Choose the “Savings” section.\\n- Your account number is displayed on the primary account card, following the label “Main –”.\\n- To copy it, tap the primary card and select the copy icon within the “Horizon savings account number” panel.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_fa4cba39\", \"content\": \"Question: Which personal identification number should I enter for ATM cash withdrawals, and how do I modify it?\\n\\nAnswer: - The PIN linked to your Horizon card is used for ATM withdrawals. If you have not set a PIN or wish to change it, you can do so via the Horizon App.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_015d7e8a\", \"content\": \"Question: What methods can I use to add funds to my Horizon savings account?\\n\\nAnswer: - **Option {{faq_015d7e8a_001}} – Transfer via FAST**\\n  {{faq_015d7e8a_002}}. Log in to your external bank’s online platform.\\n  {{faq_015d7e8a_003}}. Add your Horizon savings account as a local beneficiary, providing the beneficiary name and your Horizon account number.\\n  {{faq_015d7e8a_004}}. Initiate the FAST transfer; the amount will be credited shortly.\\n- **Option {{faq_015d7e8a_005}} – Deposit through PayNow**\\n  {{faq_015d7e8a_006}}. If your mobile number or NRIC/FIN is already linked to PayNow with another bank, deregister it first.\\n  {{faq_015d7e8a_007}}. Open the Horizon App, go to the Payments tab, and select “Register for PayNow” if you haven’t done so.\\n  {{faq_015d7e8a_008}}. Complete the registration, then send a PayNow payment to your registered mobile number or NRIC/FIN, and the funds will appear in your Horizon savings account.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contains `task.customer_component`: the intent\n          formulator's resolved sub-query for that task. Evaluate a task ONLY\n          against its own `customer_component` and that task's candidate\n          parents.\n        - Each Task Input may include `prior_sufficiency_audit_history` from\n          earlier attempts for the same task in this turn. Read it before\n          judging the current candidates and remain consistent with its prior\n          sufficiency judgments. This history is internal audit context only;\n          it is not customer-facing evidence and does not authorize any new\n          factual claim.\n        - Classify each task as SUFFICIENT, PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT, or\n          INSUFFICIENT. Judge whether the supplied parents provide useful,\n          materially relevant information for the task—not whether they repeat\n          t