{"timestamp": "2026-08-27T05:52:21.791+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_a650460c-4278-49b4-8f5e-819a1668a1ab", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently for whether its supplied\n        parents are response-ready: they must contain enough materially\n        relevant, grounded information for the assistant to give the customer\n        a useful FAQ response.\n\n        Original User Message (advisory context only; never use it as an\n        individual task's completeness target): tell me about the fee, and how to apply for a loan, and what is the exact routing number for wire transfers to my deposit account\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nUser: tell me about the fee, and how to apply for a loan, and what is the exact routing number for wire transfers to my deposit account\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"procedural\": \"Locate the nine-digit routing number on your monthly statement or within the secure mobile banking app.\", \"policy\": \"Routing numbers are specific to the financial institution and are required for all incoming wire transfers.\", \"conceptual\": \"A routing number is a unique identifier used to direct funds to the correct bank during transfers.\", \"target_commercial_product\": [\"Deposit_Account\", \"Horizon_APP\"], \"target_intent\": [\"Account Management\", \"Application\", \"Authentication And Security\", \"Branch And ATM Locator\", \"Card Logistics\", \"Eligibility\", \"Features And Limits\", \"Fees And Charges\", \"General Inquiries\", \"Interest And Rates\", \"Payments And Transfers\", \"Profile Updates\", \"Rewards And Promotions\", \"Transaction Disputes\"], \"customer_component\": \"Provide the routing number for wire transfers to my deposit account.\", \"direct_query\": \"Provide the routing number for wire transfers to my deposit account.\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_3\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Locate the nine-digit routing number on your monthly statement or within the secure mobile banking app.\", \"policy\": \"Routing numbers are specific to the financial institution and are required for all incoming wire transfers.\", \"conceptual\": \"A routing number is a unique identifier used to direct funds to the correct bank during transfers.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [{\"attempt\": 1, \"status\": \"INSUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [], \"reason\": \"The provided parents discuss PayNow, payroll deposits, GIRO transfers, and recurring transfers. None of these provide the routing number for wire transfers to a deposit account.\", \"evidence_delta\": []}, {\"attempt\": 2, \"status\": \"INSUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [], \"reason\": \"The provided parents discuss account numbers, savings pots, and transfer methods like FAST and PayNow, but none provide a routing number for wire transfers to a deposit account.\", \"evidence_delta\": []}], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_824abbaf\", \"content\": \"Question: What steps do I need to follow to change my mobile phone number after it has been linked to my Horizon Savings Account for PayNow?\\n\\nAnswer: - Updating your mobile number for PayNow can be done in three straightforward actions:\\n{{faq_824abbaf_001}}. Unlink the existing phone number from PayNow through the Horizon App.\\n{{faq_824abbaf_002}}. Enter and save your new mobile number in the app’s profile settings.\\n{{faq_824abbaf_003}}. Re‑enroll the new number for PayNow by associating it with your Horizon Savings Account.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_7d49c937\", \"content\": \"Question: What are the available ways to fund my Horizon Bank savings account?\\n\\nAnswer: - **Method {{faq_7d49c937_001}} – Bank transfer via FAST**\\n  {{faq_7d49c937_002}}. Log in to the online portal of your other bank.\\n  {{faq_7d49c937_003}}. Add your Horizon Bank savings account as a local beneficiary, providing the beneficiary name and your Horizon savings account number.\\n  {{faq_7d49c937_004}}. Initiate the FAST transfer; the money will be credited to your Horizon account shortly.\\n- **Method {{faq_7d49c937_005}} – PayNow**\\n  {{faq_7d49c937_006}}. If your mobile number or NRIC/FIN is already linked to PayNow with a different bank, first remove that linkage.\\n  {{faq_7d49c937_007}}. Open the Horizon App, tap the Payments tab, and select “Register for PayNow” if you haven’t done so already.\\n  {{faq_7d49c937_008}}. Complete the registration, then send a PayNow payment to the registered mobile number or NRIC/FIN; the funds will appear in your Horizon savings account.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_95665e33\", \"content\": \"Question: How do I locate my Horizon Bank account number within the app?\\n\\nAnswer: - Open the Horizon App and sign in.\\n- Navigate to the **Savings** tab.\\n- Your account number appears on the primary account card under the \\\"Main\\\" heading.\\n- To copy it, tap the card and select the copy icon shown in the \\\"Horizon savings account number\\\" panel.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_32c1662f\", \"content\": \"Question: Can I initiate a transfer in a currency other than Singapore dollars?\\n\\nAnswer: - Horizon Bank currently supports only domestic transfers denominated in SGD. We do not handle inbound or outbound foreign‑currency transfers, nor any cross‑border payments, whether they are in SGD or other currencies.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contains `task.customer_component`: the intent\n          formulator's resolved sub-query for that task. Evaluate