{"timestamp": "2026-08-27T09:45:26.275+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_43fa923f-6fd9-4110-b6a0-5799da246096", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n    PRE-DECOMPOSED CUSTOMER COMPONENTS (from Triage; already screened for financial relevance and compliance): [{'component_id': 'subquery_1', 'customer_component': 'How to update KYC information'}, {'component_id': 'subquery_2', 'customer_component': 'Process for applying for a credit card'}]\n    This list is the complete, final partition of the customer's request. Do NOT merge, split, drop, or invent components — process every one exactly as given.\n\n    PRODUCT/INTENT MATRIX (Valid Nouns and Verbs):\n    {'ALL': ['Account Management', 'Authentication And Security', 'Features And Limits', 'General Inquiries', 'Payments And Transfers', 'Rewards And Promotions'], 'Credit_Card': ['Account Management', 'Application', 'Authentication And Security', 'Card Logistics', 'Eligibility', 'Features And Limits', 'Fees And Charges', 'General Inquiries', 'Interest And Rates', 'Loan And Credit Management', 'Payments And Transfers', 'Profile Updates', 'Rewards And Promotions', 'Transaction Disputes'], 'Debit_Card': ['Account Management', 'Application', 'Authentication And Security', 'Card Logistics', 'Eligibility', 'Features And Limits', 'Fees And Charges', 'General Inquiries', 'Payments And Transfers', 'Profile Updates', 'Rewards And Promotions', 'Transaction Disputes'], 'Deposit_Account': ['Account Management', 'Application', 'Authentication And Security', 'Branch And ATM Locator', 'Card Logistics', 'Eligibility', 'Features And Limits', 'Fees And Charges', 'General Inquiries', 'Interest And Rates', 'Payments And Transfers', 'Profile Updates', 'Rewards And Promotions', 'Transaction Disputes'], 'Horizon_APP': ['Account Management', 'Authentication And Security', 'Features And Limits', 'General Inquiries', 'Payments And Transfers', 'Profile Updates', 'Rewards And Promotions'], 'Insurance': ['Features And Limits', 'General Inquiries', 'Rewards And Promotions', 'Wealth And Insurance'], 'Mutual_Funds': ['Fees And Charges', 'General Inquiries', 'Wealth And Insurance'], 'Personal_Loan': ['Account Management', 'Application', 'Authentication And Security', 'Eligibility', 'Features And Limits', 'Fees And Charges', 'General Inquiries', 'Interest And Rates', 'Loan And Credit Management', 'Rewards And Promotions'], 'Rewards_Program': ['Authentication And Security', 'Features And Limits', 'General Inquiries', 'Payments And Transfers', 'Rewards And Promotions'], 'Stocks': ['Fees And Charges', 'General Inquiries', 'Wealth And Insurance']}\n\n    INTENT DEFINITION GUIDELINE:\n    \n1. Acquisition & Setup (Getting Started)\nApplication: How to apply, steps involved, document submission, or checking status. \nEligibility: Qualify for a product, income/age requirements, existing relationships. \nCard Logistics: Physical handling. Activation, delivery, reporting lost/stolen, replacement. \n2. Product Knowledge (Understanding the Asset)\nFeatures And Limits: General mechanics, benefits, usage limits, overseas use, digital wallets. \nFees And Charges: Costs, annual fees, fall-below fees, penalties, fee waivers. \nInterest And Rates: Interest accumulation, base rates, bonus criteria, payout timing. \n3. Daily Servicing (Account & Money Movement)\nAccount Management: Checking balances, dormancy, linking accounts, account cancellation. \nProfile Updates: Address, phone number, and email updates. \nPayments And Transfers: PayNow, FAST, GIRO, bill payments, cheque deposits, transfer errors. \nTransaction Disputes: Unrecognized charges, double billing, refunds, declined transactions. \n4. Specialized Financial Services\nLoan And Credit Management: Repayment schedules, installments, balance transfers, hardship. \nWealth And Insurance: Investments, stocks, mutual funds, auto-invest, insurance premiums, claims. \nRewards And Promotions: Earning points, cashback, mercha