ilable-information statement):\n        []\n\n        Customer-Facing Answer:\n        \"Here is the process for applying for a Horizon Bank credit card:\n\nStart a Horizon credit-card request through a partner's mobile app or website, which is handled on a secure Horizon Bank web portal.\n\nSingaporean citizens and permanent residents can utilize MyInfo to auto-populate personal details for expedited form completion. Foreign applicants should have a passport and most recent payslip ready for upload or photo capture via the Horizon App.\n\nYou will receive an immediate notification of the decision via email or SMS. The majority of applications can be completed in under {{faq_2cb724a1_001}} minutes, though some instances may require additional information, potentially extending processing time to up to {{faq_2cb724a1_002}} working days.\n\nTo update your identification or KYC (Know Your Customer — a standard process banks use to verify customer identity) documents, you can submit your details directly using the Resubmit KYC Document option below.\"\n\n        Customer-Facing Clarification:\n        \"\"\n\n        Complete Customer-Facing UI Payload:\n        \"{\"uiType\": \"blocks\", \"options\": [], \"stepDetails\": [], \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"items\": [], \"extendedText\": \"\", \"listClarificationText\": \"\", \"responseBlocks\": [{\"type\": \"stepper\", \"contextText\": \"Here is the process for applying for a Horizon Bank credit card:\", \"text\": \"\", \"items\": [{\"number\": 1, \"label\": \"Initiate Application\", \"detail\": \"Start a Horizon credit-card request through a partner's mobile app or website, which is handled on a secure Horizon Bank web portal.\", \"status\": \"current\"}, {\"number\": 2, \"label\": \"Provide Details\", \"detail\": \"Singaporean citizens and permanent residents can utilize MyInfo to auto-populate personal details for expedited form completion. Foreign applicants should have a passport and most recent payslip ready for upload or photo capture via the Horizon App.\", \"status\": \"upcoming\"}, {\"number\": 3, \"label\": \"Receive Decision and Updates\", \"detail\": \"You will receive an immediate notification of the decision via email or SMS. The majority of applications can be completed in under {{faq_2cb724a1_001}} minutes, though some instances may require additional information, potentially extending processing time to up to {{faq_2cb724a1_002}} working days.\", \"status\": \"upcoming\"}], \"options\": [], \"progressTitle\": \"Credit Card Application Steps\", \"stepDetails\": [], \"currentStep\": 1, \"totalSteps\": 3, \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"extendedText\": \"\"}, {\"type\": \"text\", \"contextText\": \"\", \"text\": \"To update your identification or KYC (Know Your Customer — a standard process banks use to verify customer identity) documents, you can submit your details directly using the Resubmit KYC Document option below.\", \"items\": [], \"options\": [], \"progressTitle\": \"\", \"stepDetails\": [], \"currentStep\": null, \"totalSteps\": null, \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"extendedText\": \"\"}]}\"\n        \n\n    \nPRECISION REFERENCE CONTRACT:\n- A token matching `{{faq_*}}` is a database-backed exact-value reference,\n  never missing, unknown, incomplete, or a customer-visible template.\n- It may represent an exact amount, rate, limit, date, threshold, or other\n  precise value. Treat it as the underlying approved fact for relevance,\n  sufficiency, generation, compliance, and groundedness.\n- Preserve the token exactly in any draft. The backend deterministically\n  substitutes its authoritative value only after outbound validation.\n- Never reject, weaken, or describe evidence as unavailable merely because the\n  exact value is represented by a `{{faq_*}}` token.\n- Within the stated scope, \"up to {{faq_*}}\" expresses an exact maximum. It\n  supports the bounded conclusion that the stated coverage or benefit does not\n 