{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T04:51:54.539+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_2c022427-3876-4f70-9bc8-6ac0bd8ab7b8", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        INCREMENTAL TOOL-CALLING PLANNER\n        You must plan tool tasks to address the customer's financial subqueries.\n        For each subquery listed under \"Subqueries with a remaining gap this\n        round\" below, decide which registered, enabled tool(s) are\n        genuinely RELEVANT -- whose own description actually matches what\n        the customer needs -- and propose a task for each one that applies.\n        Judge relevance only; do not weigh cost yourself.\n\n        Tool cost characteristics (for the \"rag_role\" decision below only):\n        - \"api\", \"deeplink\", and \"service_request\" are each a single,\n          deterministic operation -- effectively free once dispatched.\n        - \"rag\" requires an internal iterative retrieval process that can\n          take several rounds and several model calls to converge -- the\n          only tool with real cost.\n\n        Financial subqueries: [{\"subquery_id\": \"subquery_1\", \"customer_component\": \"Inquiry regarding the process of opening a new bank account.\"}, {\"subquery_id\": \"subquery_2\", \"customer_component\": \"Inquiry regarding whether opening a bank account automatically includes a credit card account.\"}]\n        Subqueries with a remaining gap this round: [\"subquery_1\"]\n        Validated terminal tool results: [{\"subquery_id\": \"subquery_1\", \"tool_name\": \"rag\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"result\": {\"retrieval_state\": \"PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [\"faq_10f9fec0\"]}, \"availability_reason\": \"\"}, {\"subquery_id\": \"subquery_2\", \"tool_name\": \"rag\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"result\": {\"retrieval_state\": \"SUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [\"faq_93d37190\"]}, \"availability_reason\": \"\"}]\n        Enabled tool regis