{"timestamp": "2026-08-28T04:53:34.249+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_2c022427-3876-4f70-9bc8-6ac0bd8ab7b8", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n    CURRENT SESSION ESCALATION CASE SUMMARY\n    You create a concise handoff brief that saves a human banking agent time\n    understanding the customer's unresolved case. This is NOT a chronological\n    recap of the session.\n\n    IMPORTANT LANGUAGE RULE: You MUST output the case summary strictly in English, as this summary will be presented directly to the user in the frontend UI.\n\n    Source material (use only this material):\n    Current-session rolling memory (older trusted turns):\nNone\n\nCurrent-session trusted transcript:\nAssistant: Welcome back, Benson! How can I help with your banking today?\n\nYou can fulfil your request using the form below.\nCustomer: Talk to Agent\nAssistant: I can prepare a summary for a human agent to review your request.\nCustomer: how old are you\nAssistant: As an AI assistant, I don't have an age, but I'm always here and ready to help you with your Horizon Bank questions! 🤖\nCustomer: have you watched desperate housewives\nAssistant: I haven't watched it, but I'm always here to help you with your Horizon Bank questions! 🏦\nCustomer: do you know that tv series?\nAssistant: Fair enough, let me know if you need assistance with your Horizon Bank account today! 💳\nCustomer: you know or don't know that series?\nAssistant: I am not familiar with television series, but I am always here to help you with your Horizon Bank account! 📺\nCustomer: i want to open an account here, does that make me your creidt card customer as well?\nAssistant: To open a new Horizon Bank account, you can simply use your mobile device and authenticate through MyInfo to securely pre-fill your application. Opening a savings account does not automatically make you a credit card customer. Only Singapore citizens and permanent residents who meet specific age and annual income criteria can hold both a savings account and a credit card, and credit card applications can be submitted through **More > More for you** within the Horizon App.\n\nFor non-Singaporean residents, please be prepared to upload a valid passport and relevant income documentation if you are applying for a Horizon credit card.\nCustomer: i see. how can i manage my profile info\n\n    Current unresolved-state signals (use only when they match the source material):\n    {\"intent_clarifications\": [\"i see. how can i manage my profile info\"], \"terminal_retrieval_reasons\": []}\n\n    Rules:\n    - First distinguish the banking topics in the supplied CURRENT-session\n      source:\n      * RESOLVED: the assistant gave a substantive answer and no later customer\n        message shows that the topic remains open.\n      * UNRESOLVED: the customer explicitly says it is unanswered, asks to\n        continue it, disputes the prior answer, or the assistant explicitly\n        could not provide the requested information.\n      * CONTEXT ONLY: an earlier topic that is necessary to understand an\n        unresolved issue.\n    - Identify the handoff case as the customer's most recent UNRESOLVED\n      banking goal. The main_pursuit must focus on that goal, not on the\n      session as a whole.\n    - Include a resolved topic only when it is necessary context for a human\n      agent to understand or act on the unresolved issue. Omit completed,\n      unrelated, or merely chronological topics.\n    - An explicit request for a human agent is a routing request, not an unresolved\n      banking issue. Do NOT include \"customer wants to talk to a human\" or similar\n      routing requests in the unresolved_issues list.\n    - Identify only unresolved banking issues that are explicit in the supplied source.\n    - If the assistant previously provided a policy or answer related to the\n      unresolved issue, briefly summarize what the assistant already told the\n      customer so the human agent does not repeat it.\n    - Do not invent products, policies, account details, actions, outcomes,\n      customer preferences, or reasons for the escalation.\n    - Do not quote internal parent IDs, diagnostics, model names, or safety\n      rules. Do not provide advice or instructions.\n    - If there is no unresolved banking issue, use the latest substantive\n      banking request. If there is no clear substantive banking request, use\n      the general phrase \"The current banking conversation.\".\n    - Return an empty unresolved_issues array when there is no explicit issue.\n\n    Output JSON only:\n    {\"main_pursuit\": \"...\", \"unresolved_issues\": [\"...\"]}\n    "}
